    ^{:go/apos {0 [255 2] 1 [255 65]} :go/pos {:colon [255 40]}} ["func:_lzma._decode_filter_properties" "Return a bytes object encoding the options (properties) of the filter specified by *filter* (a dict).\n\nThe result does not include the filter ID itself, only the options."]
    ^{:go/apos {0 [256 2] 1 [256 65]} :go/pos {:colon [256 40]}} ["func:_lzma._encode_filter_properties" "Return a bytes object encoding the options (properties) of the filter specified by *filter* (a dict).\n\nThe result does not include the filter ID itself, only the options."]
